        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCCIR19, Circulaire Knob with Arched Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Circulaire Knob with Arc Plate has a traditional design that makes it well-suited for use on historic homes or even new builds were a classic look is desired. The Circulaire Knob with Arched Plate is available in a wide array of finishes and will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage or privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/circulaire-knob-arc-tall-plate-single-cylinder-entryset-grandeur-arccir19entr\"><b> Circulaire Knob with Arc Tall Plate Single Cylinder Entryset</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/circulaire-knobset-with-arc-rose-grandeur-arccir\"><b> Circulaire Knobset with Arc Short Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Circulaire Half-Round Knob with Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Circulaire Knob with Arched Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCTP-specifications.pdf?v=1704262363\" target=\"new\"><b>Arc Tall Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
