                "title": "Circulaire Knob with Arc Plate",
                "description": "The Circulaire Knob with Arc Plate has a traditional design that makes it well-suited for use on historic homes or even new builds were a classic look is desired. The Circulaire Knob with Arched Plate is available in a wide array of finishes and will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n",
